hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22285","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, Mamar informed us, from al-Zuhri, from Ibn al-Musayyab, he said: Hassan ibn Thabit recited while he was in the mosque, and Umar passed by him and glanced at him. Hassan said: By Allah, I recited in it one better than you, and he feared he would cast him with the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, so he passed and left him."
